  raspberryDialogueBoxImage: {fileID: 0}
  playerDialogueBoxImage: {fileID: 0}
  characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
  characterIdleImage: {fileID: 0}
  characterHappyImage: {fileID: 0}
  characterAngryImage: {fileID: 0}
  characterFlirtyImage: {fileID: 0}
  heartMeterPanel: {fileID: 1990534927}
  heartMeterhalfImage: {fileID: 1622764459}
  heartMeter25Image: {fileID: 977853384}
  heartMeter75Image: {fileID: 927940934}
  heartMeteremptyImage: {fileID: 189414438}
  heartMeterfullImage: {fileID: 2115830507}
  ThemeSongCreepy: {fileID: 0}
  ThemeSongBGM: {fileID: 0}
  GirlGiggle: {fileID: 0}
  GirlDisgust: {fileID: 0}
  ButtonFeedback: {fileID: 0}
  HeartMeterIncrease: {fileID: 0}
  HeartMeterDecrease: {fileID: 0}
  sentences:
  - umm, *blush*...bonjour mon cherrie.
  - your name is?
  - it is...nice to meet you {Name}
  - ...
  - Umm, Monsieur Chocolat...?
  - Oh yes, I must ask. What is your favourite croissant flavour?
  - Matcha. The grass flavoured drink? I mean, I guess...
  - But again, I wound not choose me either.
  - 'Oh...no. Not that flavour, it brings me horrible memories. '
  - Horrible memories? about?
  - Dame, Framboje. The cupcake in the next isle is my current ex. AfterI cheated
    on her with sensational strawberry...her cousin.
  - It was rather out of charcater for me to do so.
  - Why that's good to hear, beacuse I myself am a chocolate filled croissant.
  - Although, I can't say I'm the best.
  - Why would you say that?
  - I am naturally reclusive. My speech, not the best.
  - What is a pastry if it cannot be desired and consumed by a customer. Simply because
    I fear humans.
  - Well, do you fear me?
  - ...
  - Monsieur...
  - If I said that I was afraid would you still desire me?
  - Yes, because fear has an opposite that we can aim to achieve, as long as you
    are willing.
  - '{Name}, would you truly be patient with me and wait for me?'
  - You are worth every bit of patience that I posses.
  - In that case you may eat me. You've shown me enough of your sincerity.
  - No
  - What would be the point of continuing the date if you fear me?
  - But....{Name}, I could learn to not fear you.
  - And how long would that take? Would it even be worth it?
  - ...
  - Exactly.
